# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# The history carries three author identities, all of them the same person. Until
# this file existed they resolved correctly only on a machine with the owner's
# GLOBAL mailmap configured — which is not a property of the repository, so
# GitHub and every fresh clone showed all three. This makes the resolution
# travel with the code, and needs no history rewrite.
#
# "Michael Arnold" is the owner's full given name (Michael Jaret Arnold); the
# ORCID record carries it as an other-name. There is no third-party copyright
# in this history: every commit is the same author.
